    "q-94297": {
      "dom_id": "step-q94297",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,D=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrices shown above. \nGiven that $D={P}^{T}\\,AP,$ where $P$ is an orthogonal matrix, which of the following could be the second column of the matrix $P?$",
      "worked_solution": "Recall that a matrix $A$ is orthogonally diagonalizable if there exists an orthogonal matrix $P$ such that\n\n$$\nA=PD{P}^{T},\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is a diagonal matrix. Equivalently,\n\n$$\nD={P}^{T}AP.\n$$\n\nMoreover, a matrix $A$ is orthogonally diagonalizable if and only if it is symmetric.\n\nFirst, note that $A$ is symmetric and $D$ is diagonal. Therefore, $D={P}^{T}\\,AP$ gives an orthogonal diagonalization of $A.$\n\nFrom the diagonal matrix $D$ we deduce that the eigenvalues of the matrix $A$ are ${\\lambda }_{1}=-3,$ ${\\lambda }_{2}=0,$ and ${\\lambda }_{3}=8.$ So, the second column of $P$ corresponds to the eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{2}=0.$ \n\nNow, we need to find an eigenvector that corresponds to ${\\lambda }_{2}=0.$ Computing $A-0I,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-0I & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]-0[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-0I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector \n\n$$\n{v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere $‖{v}_{2}‖=\\sqrt{2}.$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm, we obtain the second column of $P:$ \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ 0 \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-94297-a",
